Z||000014||Leadfoot||10-15-2001||12:24 PM||||Kasdan it might be:<P>1) Linkage out of adjustment.<BR>2) Rear band out of adjustment.<BR>3) Valve body malfunction.<BR>4) Rear servo or front clutch malfunction.<P>If you tell me what tranny you have I might be able to get you a pdf that shows how to adjust (1) and (2).||||reg||1
Z||000015||Formula||10-15-2001||05:14 PM||||it shouldnt have a flywheel, if you have one in there that could be your problem  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>I would check the cable that runs from the top of the transmission that goes to the selector, or try taking it out and readjusting (fiero experince lol)||||reg||1
